# G9 (graphics): the Save As drop-downs by their arrow buttons. The Look in arrow opens its list and an entry of it is chosen, the Save as type
# arrow opens its list and a click on the arrow again shuts it, the arrow once more and Rich Text Format is chosen, the name is typed and Save
# is clicked. Every frame's CRC-32 must equal the host's in both graphics modes.
@dialog
@dir QUILL
@place Quill C:\QUILL
@cwd C:\DOCS
@copy letter.qld DOCS\
@copy letter.rtf DOCS\
@stamp DOCS\LETTER.QLD 2026-11-24 18:45
@stamp DOCS\LETTER.RTF 2026-11-02 09:05
@open C:\DOCS\LETTER.QLD
f10 down down down enter      # File > Save As...
@click 347 83                 # the Look in arrow: its list opens
@click 150 118                # an entry of it
@click 611 369                # the Save as type arrow: its list opens
@click 611 369                # the arrow again: it shuts
@click 611 369
@click 500 334                # Rich Text Format
@click 150 369                # the name field
end bspace bspace bspace bspace bspace bspace bspace bspace bspace bspace
n e w
@click 490 391                # Save
